<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13507" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόπροθε</span></b> , before vowels <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόπρο-θεν</span></b> , Adv., prop. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>from afar,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰύζουσιν ἀ. οὐδ᾽ ἐθέλουσιν ἀντίον
					ἐλθέμεναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.66
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. εἰς ἓν ἰόντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.39
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1244
			</span></i>, etc.; but in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόπροθι</span>
			, <i>afar off, far away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὖθι μένειν παρὰ νηυσὶν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.209
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				17.501
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στῆθ᾽ οὕτω ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					6.218
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. εἰν ἁλὶ κεῖται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					7.244
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				9.188
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				17.408
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				595
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ichn.</u>
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen.,
				<i>far away from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφθαλμῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archil.
					25
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰζηῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					1.414
				</span></i>
			.</div>
